window.products.push({"id":292018,"name":"Blue Diamond Cookware Diamond Infused Ceramic Nonstick, 5.5QT Dutch Oven with Glass Lid, Lightweight Design, PFAS-Free, Dishwasher Safe, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61suhjOayOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Big Batch is everything you love about Dutch ovens without the hassle! Big Batch’s forged aluminum construction makes it 50% lighter than cast iron, so you get incredible performance without struggling to move the pot. This quick-heating construction also gets you cooking faster—you get cast iron performance without the weight or the wait! And thanks to Blue Diamond’s signature nonstick coating, it wipes clean and is dishwasher safe for tough messes. Blue Diamond’s ultra-durable diamond-infused ceramic coating is 5x harder and 10x longer lasting then traditional nonstick coatings, making it scratch-resistant and metal utensil safe. It’s also free of PFAS, PFOA, lead, and cadmium. Big Batch’s cook and look dome lid is temperature shock-resistant to give you an easy look at your meals without losing heat. The domed shape also provides 85% more room than a traditional lid and promotes better airflow. The huge 5QT capacity ensures you have plenty of room for all your meals while the heavy-duty forged bases prevent warping, wobbling, or degrading over time. Oven and broiler safe up to 600°F, glass lids up to 350°F. Dishwasher safe. Limited lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61suhjOayOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Diamond","source_asin":"B0B34P6998","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B34P6998","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B34P6998","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":292019,"name":"Aprice Non Slip Bathtub Mat Baby Toddler Shower Bath Tub Mat Kids Yellow Duck","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G5T8tchML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features, Material- EPVC Suction Cups- 277 suctions cups, durable grip Size- 27 in L x 14 in W Weight- 1.23 lb Color- White Package: 1x Aprice Bathtub Mat Non-slip for baby kids children. How does it prevent falling? —— Bathtub Mat surface has anti-slip lines to prevent falling and increase friction, keep stable. And 277 suction cups grap firmly on any clean and smooth surface on the back side. Can I use the bath mat on my tiled or textured shower/tub floor? —— They work on smooth, non-textured shower/tub floors. Unfortunately, textured and tiled surfaces do not allow for the suction cup to properly adhere to the surface. Therefore we recommend our mat for smooth surfaces only. How big is this mat? —— Our generous sized 27 in x 14 in mats which is enough places for A baby / kids to sit on. Will the bath mat color fade? —— It has bright color but will not fade or falling. It is made of environmental protection Non-toxic Material, BPA Free, Latex Free, No Toxic Smell. How can I clean this mat? —— To use a brush to clean the dirt on it , we suggest to clean it 1-2 times in a week. Or you just can throw it to the washing machine to clean. Can I really put this mat in the washing machine? —— Yes, you can. Simply throw the mat in your washing machine on cold with gentle detergent (no bleach) and air dry. We recommend rinsing and drying your bath mat after each use. How long could this bathub mat last? —— This durable anti-slip bathtub mat could last 6-12 month under cleaning and protection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G5T8tchML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aprice","source_asin":"B07D3W21NT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3W21NT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D3W21NT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
