window.products.push({"id":292025,"name":"10L!10L!10L!2 Compartment Lunch Box,2 Deck/Dual Compartment/2 Compartments/Double Deck Insulated Lunch Bag Box,Lunch Box for Men/Women,Lunch Bag for W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BQ0HkU6eS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Choose Cheeerrrs 2 Deck/Dual Compartment/2 Compartments/Double Deck lunch bag box Enjoy your best tasting meal whenever and wherever you want! High Quality Cheeerrrs Dual Compartment Insulated Lunch Bag, featured with premium unique design, provides a healthier lifestyle for you, your family and your friend ！LUNCH BOX HIGH QUALITY ★Durable Construction : Made of high quality material, durable, waterproof and leakproof, rip-resistant and maximum durability. ★Dual Zippers: Premium reinforced metal SBS dual zippers, secure zipper closure and metal buckle ensure smooth open. ★Reusable：Load-shaking Test Report shows that lunch tote bag can bear more than 5,000+ times irregular machine shaking continuously when the lunch bag loaded 22lb(10kg) LUNCH BAG HEALTHIER LIFE ★Keep fresh: Interior with thick thermal insulation wall to keep food cold/warm/fresh for hours. INSULATED LUNCH BAG BOX FOR MEN WOMEN AND KIDS AMULTIPLE USAGE It can be used at work, at school and at any free time. The style is suitable for picnic, street shopping, dinner, class study, outdoor travel, office work, etc. LUNCH BOX FOR WOMEN MEN AND KIDS PORTABLE LUNCH BAG ★Detachable & adjustable shoulder strap and padded handle ensure you more comfortable carrying options. Easy to free your hands once switch to a shoulder bag. ★Spacious & Numerous Pockets: Two main compartments for large amount of meal, food, drinks, snacks for the entire day, two side pockets for water bottles and four extra pockets for keys, cards & extra stuffs. The Cheeerrrs exclusive insulated lunch bag is here to make your life easier and help you enjoy your healthy and delicious meals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BQ0HkU6eS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheeerrrs","source_asin":"B097GHPGJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097GHPGJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097GHPGJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":292026,"name":"Portrait of a Young Woman, 1896-97 by Gustav Klimt, 14x19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zZSxoYsBL._AC_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a portrait of a young woman. Gustav Klimt was an Austrian symbolist painter and one of the most prominent members of the Vienna Secession movement. Klimt is noted for his paintings, murals, sketches, and other art objects. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zZSxoYsBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BM8XWQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BM8XWQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BM8XWQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
