window.products.push({"id":292076,"name":"Donxote Wooden Spatula Set of 2, 11.8 in Kitchen Cooking Flat Natural Wood Scraper, Spatulas Perfect for Wok Flipping & Turning, Multipurpose Cookware","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f70R32f6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH-QUALITY FLAT WOODEN SPATULA - It is made of one-piece beech and can be used as an ultralight, durable and functional kitchen accessory for cooking enthusiasts. The size of the wooden spatula is 11.8 inches. You can use it to fry, stir-fry or stir jam. Since the head of the wooden spatula is very thin, you can turn over bread, hamburgers and the like easily. EASY TO MAINTAIN & CLEAN - The surface of the flat wooden spatula is not covered by any coatings. After receiving it, you can add some oil (edible oil or olive oil) directly on its surface and an protective film will be formed after drying, which can prevent cracking and prolong service life. In terms of cleaning, you only need to use a soft sponge with warm water and slight soap to rinse it (dish-washing machine is not applicable) and then keep ventilation and dry. 100% NATURAL, SOLID & HEALTHY - The wooden spatula is made of natural solid wood with heat resistance and original texture and without any paint or wax, so it will not bring any harmful into your food. MULTI-PUROSE USE - The perfect scraper with a wooden board can be used by both left and right hands. The flat bottom is thin enough to scrape a large pan with ease, break up minced meat or fry eggs. Salad tongs can be formed by the two scrapers! The sides are straight enough to use as a bench scraper in a pinch. The scraper can be used to cut apart food when stirring, mixing, turning over, tasting and cooking dishes. LIFETIME WARRANTY & 100% REFUND GUARANTEE - We're sure you'll like our flat spatula! If not fully satisfied, please don’t hesitate to contact us. As a small family owned business, we care greatly every our customer's feeling happy, and we have been always looking foward to being better. With nothing to lose, just head to get your Donxote wood spatula now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f70R32f6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Donxote","source_asin":"B0BTW7M16M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTW7M16M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTW7M16M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
