window.products.push({"id":292208,"name":"Duraflame DFI021ARU Electric Log Set Heater with Realistic Ember Bed and Logs, 20.5\" W x 8.66\" D x 12\" H, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81exZUQDtzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Place this LED log set with realistic ember bed into an existing fireplace and watch the dancing flames project onto the back of the existing fireplace. The realistic log set and ember bed sit in an Antique Black finish fire grate and feature a rolling, pulsating flame effect that works with or without heat. Provides supplemental zone heating up to 400 square feet. No hookups or vents required, just plug it in. Control the log set from anywhere in the room using the included remote control. Manufactured and distributed by Twin-Star International, Inc., under license from Duraflame, Inc. duraflame, the flame symbol and logo are registered trademarks of Duraflame, Inc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81exZUQDtzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duraflame","source_asin":"B0C43X3YJL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C43X3YJL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C43X3YJL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":292209,"name":"LENYEE Artificial Flowers in Vase Peonies - Touch Like Real Centerpieces for Tables Indoor Plants Farmhouse Bathroom Decor Home Decorations for Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o0wJGUtRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Touch like real : Our artificial flowers not only a true realistic look, but also when you touch them, you have a sense of touching fresh flowers. There are even bionic plant veins on the flower petals. Their characteristic is amazing because the flower head is not easily broken by folding Artificial peony bulk with vase: 3 pcs peonies are tie-in thick glass vase to bring more pure farmhouse style to your home. The flower stems are fix with the vase, you can place it to anywhere your want to decorate without worry the flower fall Gradient plant color make the flower more real. Not like the other flower, the flower petal just only 1 color. To make sure the plant more real, we take the technology to deal with the real petal color gradient Room decor: Perfect size for decorating your living room, bathroom, bedroom, dining table. We have many colors potting, you can place the vase on wedding table, English rose will decorate your wedding more sweet Why you choose our artificial flowers: LENYEE natural touch flowers are appealing for not only their touch and feel but also their texture and vivid color. Furthermore, as a flower material, polyurethane is stable and does not change easily","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o0wJGUtRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LENYEE","source_asin":"B09QC1YQHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QC1YQHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QC1YQHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
