window.products.push({"id":292375,"name":"Divider Basket Set Compatible with Instant Pot 6 Qt | Pressure Cooker, Steamer Inner Insert Accessories, E Book | Silicone Seal Replacement, Strainer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y7etLN46L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"My Promise Some people LOVE cooking, and others would rather do anything BUT spend time in the kitchen. That wide difference is exactly why I’ve started Kindsay. I want to help ALL of you save money on your meals, nourish your families with healthier, tastier food while minimizing the amount of time and work you have to do in the kitchen. About Dawn Hi, Im Dawn, and Im an average, Midwestern woman who loves cooking and baking but has little time to do it. Im a wife with an active family and I only want the best for them. I collect kitchen power appliances, tools and accessories. My most recent fascination? The IP! Through Kindsay, Inc., Ive found lots of tools and techniques to get dinner on the table in a hurry (including lightened up cheesekcakes!). The newest Instant Pot product is one of my favorites. The 3-piece steamers basket opens up loads of cooking possibilities, but there arent a lot of recipes online. So, Kindsay and I have been working hard to create some unique dishes for you to use in your kitchen! Kindsay originally intrigued me because of their focus on health. I work in the fitness industry, and I focus on fueling my family’s bellies with the healthiest, most balanced meals I can. Our goal at Kindsay is to provide you with unique, delicious and healthy Instat Pot recipe choices so you can operate at peak performance every day, while enjoying some precious extra time with your families. My genuine hope is for you to use that amazing multicooker to make your life easier. I know youll love the divided basket and three silicone replacement lid gaskets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y7etLN46L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kindsay","source_asin":"B07L6TB8SF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L6TB8SF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L6TB8SF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
