window.products.push({"id":292430,"name":"Music Ornaments for Christmas Tree 2022 - Polyresin Electric Keyboard Ornament - Unique Music Ornaments - Piano Ornament 2022 - Instrument Ornaments -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616foT5aH3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Music Ornament – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our piano Christmas ornament 2022 is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of an electric keyboard with ribbon. Add some holiday cheer to your home and bring the magic of music to your holiday tree with this adorable electric keyboard ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – unlike other personalized piano ornaments that often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. All our music themed Christmas ornaments 2022 are delicately hand painted to ensure a unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND piano music ornament you'll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – Every year, you decorate your tree with decorations that represent the activities and special moments that bring you joy and fulfillment in life. With our Christmas tree music instrument ornaments 2022, expand your collection with the unique ornaments that represent your family’s greatest pleasures and accomplishments. Crafted with festive and vibrant colors, your music ornaments for Christmas tree will make your tree feel truly special and unique. 24 Hour order processing – these music Christmas ornaments make thoughtful gifts for piano students, piano recital gifts, piano teacher ornament gift, small piano decoration to cherish every season. Your piano ornaments for Christmas tree will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a gift box, gift bag and gift tag – no need for wrapping! this holiday season, give the gift of joy with this musical piano ornament! Happy and Satisfied Music Lovers - at Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting unique musical ornaments for Christmas tree for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship.If for any reason you don’t love your personalized music ornament, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616foT5aH3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B07G6XS3MV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G6XS3MV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G6XS3MV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
