window.products.push({"id":292659,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Fido Canning Jar 1.4922, 1L, 1 l","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fvt-G+OsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A 1L Fido jar with a vintage design, ideal for containing preserves and dry foods, but also for decorating the home, holding small objects, and making an original gift. Its iconic shaped jar, born fifty years ago, is an innovative way of serving food. With an air-tight hinged lid, the Bormioli Rocco Glass Fido Jar is suitable for storing just about anything. This beautiful jar needn't be confined to the pantry. Proudly use a combination of Fido jars as counter-top canisters to display your dry baking and cooking supplies. However, this glass storage jar can be used for so much more than storing food goods. Organize craft materials or school supplies, or use it as gift packaging for homemade crafts such as bath salts, sugar scrubs, hot cocoa mix, etc. There are so many fun possibilities--your imagination only limits you! Sold as a single glass Fido jar Capacity 100 cl - 33 3/4 oz. Height with lid engaged 160 mm - 6.25\" Diameter 106 mm - 4.25\" Hinged jar lid with replaceable rubber gasket Air-tight seal Made of soda-lime glass with natural rubber gasket Glass parts of the jar are dishwasher safe. Hand washing is recommended for the metal closer, and gasket. Made in Italy About Bormioli Rocco Since 1825 Bormioli Rocco has made glass to give your food stories their best setting. At Bormioli Rocco, they believe in the table as the place where some of the most profound and most authentic relationships are created, revived, and celebrated. It is the place where you celebrate special events and anniversaries, as well as the place where each day can be made a bit more special.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fvt-G+OsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B005GQYMHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005GQYMHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005GQYMHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":292660,"name":"The Collator by Eric Joyner Wall Decor, 35 by 47\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":93.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pQxpHBMVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a painting of a purple robot sitting on a stone pedestal in a pensive pose reminiscent of Augusta Rodin's sculpture, \"Le Penseur\" (The Thinker). Eric attended the Academy of Art and the University of San Francisco and went on to establish himself as a commercial artist, creating illustrations for Mattel Toys, Levi's, Microsoft and Showtime. A member of both San Francisco's and New York's Society of Illustrators, Joyner is an instructor and speaker at several California institutions. His work has been featured in museums, galleries and cultural institutions worldwide. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pQxpHBMVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B014A5UJE2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014A5UJE2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014A5UJE2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
