window.products.push({"id":292753,"name":"Acacia Wood Teabag Container, Acacia Tea Box with 4 Sections, Acacia Wood Rectangle Tea Chest, Holder for Tea Bags, Leaves & Herbs in Acaciawood, Tea ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mOi7X1xZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful Acacia Wood Tea Box is designed to hold your assortment of gourmet tea bags. Place out for your guests to choose their favorite at your next get-together. Store your tea in style with our Acacia Wood Teabag Container. Heat stamp with the word \"tea,\" this attractive hardwood box features 4 compartments perfectly sized for all your Earl Grey, herbal, blended and other favorite teas. Keep your tea collection and assortment organized with Acacia Tea box made from 100% Acacia. The practical tea box can also act as storage for an array of items such as crafts, screws, small supplies and other small collections. Our teabag container is the only cabinet organizer for tea bags! Store bags tea , dry container to protect flavors and eliminate tea box clutter. Find your tea quickly at tea time by keeping everything neat and organized. Our design is easy to grab and move anywhere. Place the organizer on any flat surface - a countertop or table - to pick your tea of choice. Dishwasher safe. Our tea box is great for entertaining and making your guests feel at home! We creates innovative home organization products to help you simplify and enjoy life. Impress your friends and family with this wonderfully crafted tea box for your home or present it as the perfect gift for tea lovers. Nice & Nature product is the locally made product of each Thai Tambon (sub-district). It consisted of OTOP (One Tambon one Product). The reason that we would like to promote our brand because to support local people have job to do and can work at home as a homemade. It’s like a family business so that they can work and then stay with their family.We encourage village communities to improve the local products' quality and to join e-commerce project. Nice & Nature has been a leading importer of responsibly produced and environmentally friendly Acacia wood, a wide collection of casual entertaining items and our popular Acacia. Our products are exclusively from Thai Tumbon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mOi7X1xZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nice & Nature","source_asin":"B00YA83K2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YA83K2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YA83K2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
