window.products.push({"id":292848,"name":"Mossyard 12Pcs Artificial Roses, 19.9 Inch Silk Long Stem Fake Flower for Wedding Home Office Party Decor, Centerpieces(White + Yellow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fcovqUwRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mossyard - Real Touch. Long Stemmed. Valuable. Washable. Size: Length 19.9 inch/ 50cm, the diameter of flower head is 3.15 inch/ 8cm. Material: Flower heads and leaves are made of silk( real touch), metal wire as skeleton is wrapped by plastic(stem can be bent or trimmed). Package Included:12 x Artificial Roses (No Vase in Package). Widely Useage: -Floral Arrangements -Home Decoration -Table Centerpieces -Wedding Bridal Bouquet -Party Decoration -Outdoor/Garden Decoration -Event Planner -Valentine's Day Gift -Grave/ Cemetery Decoration etc. How to Maintain 1. They can be used for outdoor decoration, but sunshine may reduce their lifetime. 2. After long time use, there maybe some sticky dust, please swip flower petals gently in light salty water or soap water,  then use clean pure water wash them twice, air-dry them, they will look realistic again. 3. Artificial flowers are flammable, please keep them away from candles, high heat, sparks fire, open flames. Note (most of artificial flowers/ plants/ vines/ lawns are suitable): 1. Please allow 1~2 cm error due to manual measurement. 2. Due to different monitor's brightness/contrast settings etc, the color tone of the website's photo may different from the actual items, please refer to the real subjects. 3. Transport in process may cause some extrusion deformation, use hair dryer to open flowers and reshape leaves, with a slight of arrangements, they can be restored. Thank you for choosing Mossyard, we'll insist on providing you valuable products and good service, also we provide Lifetime warranty + Amazon message reply service.(providing a partial refund if there is any small amount of damage).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fcovqUwRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mossyard","source_asin":"B08R8HRTKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R8HRTKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R8HRTKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
