window.products.push({"id":292862,"name":"Lancaster Cast Iron Wooden Rice Paddle - Traditional Japanese Shamoji for Mixing and Serving Rice - Handmade in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HImzE0QML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All of our handcrafted wooden spoons and serving utensils are made by Amish craftsmen. We strive to keep our supply chain and partnerships as local as possible. Each rice paddle tells a small part of that story. Our “shamoji,” as they’re called in Japanese, are made from black cherry - a hardwood that is native to the North Eastern United States. We use traditional American designs for all of our wooden spoons, making them lightweight and extremely durable for a long life in your kitchen. Our passion is to design cooking and serving utensils that enrich your life through time spent making delicious food, enjoying home-cooked meals, and building relationships around the dining table. All of our kitchenware products are designed and made in the USA and come with a Lifetime Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HImzE0QML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lancaster Cast Iron","source_asin":"B097NLPM4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097NLPM4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097NLPM4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":292863,"name":"Madhu International Mandala Curtains Boho Hippie Bedroom Living Room Balcony Valance Decor Window Treatments Psychedelic Cotton Tapestry Curtain Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NuJFNTlDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"TOP CLASS QUALITY: Perfect drapes for summer and winter! Handcrafted with pure cotton fabric, this mandala curtain tapestry is superior to other tapestries in the market and is so soft, stretchy, thick, highly reliable, and durable. The mandala art pattern, crystal clear prints, and the attractive color combination make this tapestry curtain is your favourite home decor stuff! Give a new life to your dull or perished rooms with our bohemian tapestry curtain printed with advanced HD technology. RIGHT SIZE: Create a happy mood with the help of these cotton handmade curtains! The beautiful floral patterns printed in a contrast color makes an extra elegance to these decorative curtain drapes! This curtain set contains 2 panels each measuring 41 inches wide by 87 inches long which is long enough to cover all kinds of doors and windows. Our long tapestry curtains come with built-in rod pockets which are designed to fit for curtain rods up to 2.5 inches in diameter. EASY TO MAINTAIN: Yeah, made with a unique, and hand-dyed fabric, don’t wash our boho curtains with strong washing liquids and bleaching agents to make your purchase even more rewarding. It is always recommended to wash with hands in cold water so that it will not drop its colors. Ironing it at high temperatures and long exposure to sun rays may harm the life duration and great for all ethnic savvy ones. Never worry about fading after so many washes, our tapestry curtain is long-lasting stuff! ETHNIC APPEARANCE: If you are looking to add a little bit of ethnicity and heritage to your living spaces then these Mandala curtains are just what you need! Crafted with excellent craftsmanship with a great sense of artistic touch to the curtains, they provide a soothing appearance. Indian tapestry is one of the oldest and beautiful tradition and has been around for hundreds of years! Bring the age-old tradition into your homes and add a bit of touch and flair into your lives! MUST-HAVE ACCESSORY: Add a splash of warming sense to every doorway in your house with our decorative curtains! Fashioned to offer rustic, vintage, farmhouse, shabby chic or barn look to any of your rooms, our curtains are suitable for making a fresh update and dramatic makeover. Designed to allow some light to pass through the window or door, our semi sheer tapestry curtains are ultra-thick so that people could not see into your bedroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NuJFNTlDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madhu International","source_asin":"B08ZJ9L535","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-292863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJ9L535","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJ9L535","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
